    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2954220,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Teacher Tae-woong, music appreciation for you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2957690,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll go with movie appreciation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2960790,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's why we can't really talk about music as a hobby... because everyone does it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2964960,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2966500,
    "dDurationMs": 5250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Among people who listen to music, there are some who listen very professionally, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2971750,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People who listen to music with some depth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2973440,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a maniacal way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2974920,
    "dDurationMs": 5650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I think it would be difficult to talk about those kinds of people too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2980570,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So movie appreciation for you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2982510,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2985370,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll go with YouTube appreciation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2987080,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ㅋㅋㅋ okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2989780,
    "dDurationMs": 4450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So then, like, how about we search on Google for Korean people..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2994230,
    "dDurationMs": 4910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Korean hobby rankings? Should we do it like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2999140,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Korean Gallup' — is that trustworthy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3001410,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's a research company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3004500,
    "dDurationMs": 1030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3005530,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The hobby that Koreans enjoy the most is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3008160,
    "dDurationMs": 4130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Gaming!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3012290,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It recorded a 9% response rate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3015020,
    "dDurationMs": 4150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hiking, which was number one five years ago, has risen to a tied second place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3019170,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hiking?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3020040,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The tied second place is hiking, exercise, and fitness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3024030,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That seems wrong to me?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3026970,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But besides that, there's video watching, walking, music appreciation, reading,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3032090,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Golf, fishing, travel, and things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3036830,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they chose gaming as number one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3040330,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Based on 2024."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3041540,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, but from what I saw, this seems to be skewed toward older age groups."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3044910,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, it seems like it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3046560,
    "dDurationMs": 6580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because the previous number ones were all hiking, and the age group that hikes is all elderly people, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3053140,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3053880,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'But the fact that gaming beat out other hobbies and took first place"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3057060,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was very much influenced by men.'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3059220,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The percentage of male respondents whose hobby is gaming was 15%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3062960,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For women it was 3%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3066770,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the number one hobby for men was gaming,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3069540,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the number one hobby for women was video watching."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3073140,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because men chose gaming so much,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3076900,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Overall, gaming became number one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3081380,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The men all concentrated their votes on gaming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3084290,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like they chose gaming regardless of age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3090650,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alright then, let's call it a tie."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3093070,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3094370,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But even though there was no winner, it was informative."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3098720,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3099780,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think you've learned a lot about popular hobbies in Korea,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3103900,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And among those listening to this, there are probably many people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3106850,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For whom learning Korean is a hobby,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3110430,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if there are other hobbies you enjoy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3112970,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd appreciate it if you'd leave a lot of comments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3116770,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now we're going to preview the next topic and wrap up,"
    } ]
  }, {
